      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at our Q4 risk assessment and the board is really pushing for us to move away from a centralized architecture. They're worried about a single point of failure. Can you run some projections on what a transition to a decentralized, multi-module local system would look like for our global distribution efficiency?",
