    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a fair point about the sync delays. Can you run a more granular simulation of that? I want to see exactly how much a 4-hour telemetry lag would impact our ability to redistribute critical life-saving meds if there's a sudden localized shortage or a manufacturing spike in another region. Basically, show me how much the \"resilience\" of the 50 nodes is offset by the loss of central coordination.",
